.vscode/

# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, `out/` matches at any depth and
# silently ignores any source directory that happens to share the name — which once kept a
# whole package out of a commit while the build still passed from the copy on disk. A build
# directory belongs to whichever subproject produces it, and that subproject ignores its own.
/out/
/dist/
/.next/
/data/
